Package: noxreports
Title: Editable 'bookdown' Reports for 'phipflow' PhIP-Seq Results
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Mateusz Franciszek", "Kolek", email = "mati.kolek13@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Deploys an editable 'bookdown' book next to the results of the
    'phipflow' PhIP-seq pipeline and renders it: cohort demographics, a FastQC
    summary, alpha and beta diversity, repertoire stability, POP and DELTA
    results. Results are linked in place rather than copied, and a bundle
    command zips the rendered book with only the files it references.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
